<body id="thebody" style="defaultCaption">
	<div xml:lang="en">
		<p begin="00:00:00.100" end="00:00:02.867">Here are some words<br />that begin with the letter &quot;f.&quot;</p>
		<p begin="00:00:02.867" end="00:00:04.533">(makes &quot;f&quot; sound)</p>
		<p begin="00:00:04.533" end="00:00:06.067">Flour.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:06.067" end="00:00:07.067">Flower.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:07.067" end="00:00:08.133">Fan.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:08.133" end="00:00:09.000">Fred.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:09.000" end="00:00:10.267">Fried pickle.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:10.267" end="00:00:12.067">French fries.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:12.067" end="00:00:14.400">Fish.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:14.400" end="00:00:15.533">&quot;F.&quot;</p>
		<p begin="00:00:15.533" end="00:00:16.533">(makes &quot;f&quot; sound)</p>
